    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Math is a game based on the four operations of math, testing the player's reaction speed and ability to quickly reverse the four operations of math.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The original idea for creating the game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by oral math training as a child </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a game with educational significance </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that players can improve their basic math skills and exercise their brains by playing Speed Math.   </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated number puzzles: each game is a brand new challenge, bringing you unlimited challenging fun. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic content: each puzzle can be solved with different operations, different operations have different scores, choose operations wisely to get a higher score. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable props: You can upgrade the props in the game to reduce the difficulty of the game. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art style: suitable for all ages.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Math is a game based on the four operations of math, testing the player's reaction speed and ability to quickly reverse the four operations of math.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The original idea for creating the game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by oral math training as a child </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a game with educational significance </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope that players can improve their basic math skills and exercise their brains by playing Speed Math.   </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated number puzzles: each game is a brand new challenge, bringing you unlimited challenging fun. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic content: each puzzle can be solved with different operations, different operations have different scores, choose operations wisely to get a higher score. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable props: You can upgrade the props in the game to reduce the difficulty of the game. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art style: suitable for all ages.</p></li></ul>",
